abstract: "The published results of Third Hemisphere's AI Authority Index for personal lending, Edition 1, read from 805 AI answers from ChatGPT, Claude, Copilot, Gemini, and Perplexity. The index measures AI visibility: how often AI search engines and assistants name, recommend, and cite each company."
